#: plugins/parallelport.py
msgid "Parallel port is not supported on macOS. Skipping parallel plugin."
msgstr "Le port parallèle n'est pas supporté sur macOS. Plugin ignoré."

#: plugins/parallelport.py
msgid ""
"Python Parallel module is missing. On Windows, install pyparallel (pip "
"install pyparallel) and the InpOut32 driver (provides simpleio.dll)."
msgstr ""
"La librairie Python Parallel est manquante. Sous Windows, installez "
"pyparallel (pip install pyparallel) et le pilote InpOut32 (fournit "
"simpleio.dll)."

#: plugins/parallelport.py
msgid ""
"Python Parallel module is missing. On Linux, install pyparallel (pip install "
"pyparallel) and ensure the ppdev kernel module is loaded."
msgstr ""
"La librairie Python Parallel est manquante. Sous Linux, installez "
"pyparallel (pip install pyparallel) et assurez-vous que le module noyau "
"ppdev est chargé."

#: plugins/parallelport.py
msgid ""
"Parallel port not found. Ensure the InpOut32 driver is installed (provides "
"simpleio.dll) and that a physical parallel port is available."
msgstr ""
"Port parallèle non trouvé. Vérifiez que le pilote InpOut32 est installé "
"(fournit simpleio.dll) et qu'un port parallèle physique est disponible."

#: plugins/parallelport.py
msgid ""
"Parallel port not found. Ensure /dev/parport0 exists and you have read/write "
"permissions (try: sudo chmod 666 /dev/parport0)."
msgstr ""
"Port parallèle non trouvé. Vérifiez que /dev/parport0 existe et que vous "
"avez les droits de lecture/écriture (essayez : sudo chmod 666 "
"/dev/parport0)."

#: plugins/parallelport.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Parallel port error: {error}"
msgstr "Erreur du port parallèle : {error}"

